    {
      "question": "Is this station accessible for Divyangjan passengers?",
      "answer": "Yes, Modipuram station is fully Divyangjan-friendly with ramps, elevators, and accessible facilities throughout."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the operating schedule?",
      "answer": "Namo Bharat trains operate from 6:00 AM to 10:00 PM on weekdays and 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "question": "Is parking available at this station?",
      "answer": "Yes, parking is available for four-wheelers, two-wheelers, bicycles, and helmets with reasonable daily, night, and monthly rates."
